<title>CONGO: Mystery disease hits pygmies in Congo, 41 dead.</title>
<headline>Mystery disease hits pygmies in Congo, 41 dead.</headline>
<dateline>BRAZZAVILLE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A mystery disease has killed 41 people, most of them pygmies, in less than a week in northern Congo, officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The outbreak affected forest people in Epena district 1,500 km (800 miles) north east of the capital Brazzaville, they added.</p>
<p>There were no immediate details on the symptoms.</p>
</text>
